{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>It will atone by the nefesh.</b> By the nefesh that is in it, it will atone. The meaning is a nefesh in place of a nefesh. Some interpret it like 'upon your nefashot,' but it has no other meaning, since he said 'to atone upon your nefashot.'"], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:32.657838660Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}